{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Playcraft",
    "steam_appid": 805270,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/805270/extras/da45a2caccea1bacdbef8f12c8e2bbc3.avif?t=1729299776\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Experiment game creation in an easy, fast and fun way!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Have fun Creating games without coding or Play tones of solo and multiplayer games shared by the community.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play&amp;Create first-person, third-person, top-down, solo or multiplayer games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create fast with a simple interface, without any code</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build dynamic, destructible online worlds with friends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize visuals, rules, characters, powers, vehicles, cinematics, dialogues and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No limitations, zero farming required to unlock all tools &amp; content</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Offline &amp; Online multiplayer co-creation and play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Share your games and prefabs on the Steam Workshop</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If your game stand out, have the possibility to publish on Steam directly</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Playcraft is a great way to develop your creativity while having fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Let's craft and play new games!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/805270/extras/da45a2caccea1bacdbef8f12c8e2bbc3.avif?t=1729299776\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Experiment game creation in an easy, fast and fun way!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Have fun Creating games without coding or Play tones of solo and multiplayer games shared by the community.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play&amp;Create first-person, third-person, top-down, solo or multiplayer games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create fast with a simple interface, without any code</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build dynamic, destructible online worlds with friends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize visuals, rules, characters, powers, vehicles, cinematics, dialogues and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No limitations, zero farming required to unlock all tools &amp; content</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Offline &amp; Online multiplayer co-creation and play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Share your games and prefabs on the Steam Workshop</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If your game stand out, have the possibility to publish on Steam directly</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Playcraft is a great way to develop your creativity while having fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Let's craft and play new games!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
